WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Inspect the saved cylinder and its editable drawing guide.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Draw across the cylinder surface; mirror adds the reflected stroke.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
The source stroke and reflected copy remain editable around the saved cylinder.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Select the curved stroke, move it, then undo and redo the transform.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Continue orbiting to inspect the curved result and seam.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Save the native cylinder drawing through the production save path.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Reopen the saved native drawing through the production open path. Curved strokes remain editable; no tablet pressure was measured.
